# GBNF grammar for the turn gate: one label per sentence, in order.
#
# The whole output vocabulary is three words, so there is nothing to parse
# defensively and no way for the model to answer with prose. `Manifold.Gate` maps
# the labels onto the protocol's two booleans; the only check left is that the
# number of labels matches the number of sentences.
root  ::= label (" " label)*
label ::= "chitchat" | "statement" | "question"
